  "title": "17.3. WOUND DEHISCENCE:",
  "source_sha256": "f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605",
  "block_count": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-06-020\" hidden></div>\n<h3 class=\"mm-heading mm-h3 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9081]\" style=\"background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>17.3. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>WOUND D</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>EH</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>ISCENCE:</span></h3>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9082]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Typically happens within 2 weeks of surgery (7 \u2013 12 days)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9083]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1% </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>elective</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> surgery</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9084]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Causes:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9085]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Local</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Systematic</strong></em></span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"0afed91180045ddd44d33e62\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-020\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"infections\" viewbox=\"2581275 247650 1152525 333375\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"6783c8bb2531c9b9ad1656dc608f1770ac52875f786bda090193a4d963e4a84c\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"a6798b0e5505cf55acd5\" transform=\"translate(2589291 250693)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1140737 0 L 1140737 325925 L 0 325925 Z\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-opacity=\"0\" stroke-width=\"6350\"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor=\"t\" transform=\"translate(0 45720)\"><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">infections</tspan></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9086]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Breaks in knots</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9087]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Breaks in ligatures </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9088]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tearing of tissues due to excessive tension or due to sutures placed close to the tissue edges.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9089]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Risk factors:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9090]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Old age</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9091]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>BMI</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9092]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ascites</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9093]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Jaundice </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9094]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Diabetes </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9095]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Anemia</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9096]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Chemotherapy</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9097]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>COPD</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9098]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Emergency surgery</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9099]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Raised intra \u2013 abdominal pressure like post op vomiting, ileus</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9100]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Nutritional deficiency like Vit C</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9101]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Dehiscence Prevention:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9102]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Correct risk factors </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9103]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Use of deep retention sutures + non absorbable material</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9104]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Avoidance of heavy lifting post op</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9105]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9106]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Abdominal wound dehiscence:</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9107]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Superficial skin separation \u2013 manage in ward.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9108]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Sheath separated \u2013 need repair in theatre</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9109]\" style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Failure to close leads to hernia.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9110]\" style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Perineal Dehiscence:</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9111]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Can be managed conservatively with or without antibiotic cover and observation healing with secondary intention leads to hyper granulation, Hyper granulation and discomfort hyper granulation can be managed by using silver nitrate.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9112]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Vaginal cuff dehiscence:</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9113]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Uncommon 0.14 \u2013 4%</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9114]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Can lead to evisceration of bowel that may be life threatening, morbidity and mortality 6 \u2013 22%</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9115]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>More in minimal access surgery </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9116]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Common symptoms are abdominal/ pelvic pain, pressure, bleeding or discharge.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9117]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Careful examination needed for signs of partial or full thickness dehiscence </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9118]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Management depends on clinical findings</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9119]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Recurrence is 17%.</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"ba208a688a5c05414c340857\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-020\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure ba208a688a5c05414c340857\" viewbox=\"400050 171450 3695700 3619500\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"c7966a2b6107f133a9ca325bf266a15e91dbbfb0a4ff650bdd3182b8e516789c\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-3017842c8268b0dca06a\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 3087572 0 L 3087572 3037687 L 0 3037687 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"86e4d2daec6d790675f0\" transform=\"translate(406926 174625)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 3688715 0 L 3688715 3609975 L 0 3609975 Z\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-opacity=\"0\" stroke-width=\"6350\"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor=\"t\" transform=\"translate(0 45720)\"><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"></text></g></g><g data-mm-nested-drawing=\"true\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"3017842c8268b0dca06a\" transform=\"translate(91440 45720)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-3017842c8268b0dca06a)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/5120b8692969fd670368e36ed20a755bdc81776ac28d3c618d7a80be87eaaabb.jfif\" x=\"0\" y=\"-1624318.74305556\" width=\"4523517.34646038\" height=\"9211811.62057254\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image></g></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9120]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9121]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>",
